{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Habitat Toxica!</strong><br>Team up with your friends and have fun in this online survival adventure set in the heart of the animal kingdom, filled with thrilling challenges and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a peaceful paradise where all animals lived in harmony, this land has now fallen into chaos caused by a mysterious and deadly virus. While this virus turns many animals into hostile and destructive creatures, it has caused <strong>unique mutations in certain chimpanzees</strong>, granting them enhanced cognitive awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of these special chimpanzees, your mission is to <strong>heal infected animals, save endangered species, and fight to survive</strong>. Will you be able to restore balance to this broken ecosystem?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various biomes of the infected island and discover the wildlife that inhabits them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue infected animal populations by administering the proper treatments before extinction strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather food and resources to survive in the island\u2019s harsh conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against mutated and aggressive creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame both infected and non-infected animals to gain loyal companions on your dangerous journey.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984620?t=1761281858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984620/0a9d1e512eb9d4167d2a292db28137d28af5250e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761281858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984620/5cf61f42bdd656ad8f7a0829107e61f3bd304cc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761281858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984620/5cf61f42bdd656ad8f7a0829107e61f3bd304cc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761281858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4096540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Habitat Toxica!</strong><br>Team up with your friends and have fun in this online survival adventure set in the heart of the animal kingdom, filled with thrilling challenges and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a peaceful paradise where all animals lived in harmony, this land has now fallen into chaos caused by a mysterious and deadly virus. While this virus turns many animals into hostile and destructive creatures, it has caused <strong>unique mutations in certain chimpanzees</strong>, granting them enhanced cognitive awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As one of these special chimpanzees, your mission is to <strong>heal infected animals, save endangered species, and fight to survive</strong>. Will you be able to restore balance to this broken ecosystem?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various biomes of the infected island and discover the wildlife that inhabits them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue infected animal populations by administering the proper treatments before extinction strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather food and resources to survive in the island\u2019s harsh conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against mutated and aggressive creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame both infected and non-infected animals to gain loyal companions on your dangerous journey.</p></li></